{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54156","headline":"次韵二首 二 · 詹景全","name":"次韵二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一乘元仪道无踪，居憇观心静倚松。\n三界永除几外想，一诚归礼释迦容。\n（同前）（按：李达、詹景全诗，皆转录自张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹景全","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}